    "summary": "Portrait of a young man; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young man in a pink robe kneels on a blue and white carpet while preparing to smoke from a hookah. A gold container with tassles sits on top of the red apparatus. The youth holds his dagger in his right hand. Two pears and two apples are placed on the carpet. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes. \r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
